#: prefs_guide_about.js:91 prefs_guide_about.js:187
msgid "OmniPanel"
msgstr "OmniPanel"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:97
msgid ""
"Multi-monitor productivity with configurable layouts for windows and a GNOME "
"Top Bar that seamlessly follows your focus."
msgstr ""
"Multi-monitor productivity with configurable layouts for windows and a GNOME "
"Top Bar that seamlessly follows your focus."

#: prefs_guide_about.js:109
msgid "Window Layouts & The Zone Designer"
msgstr "Window Layouts & The Zone Designer"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:112
msgid "Draw Your Workspace"
msgstr "Draw Your Workspace"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:113
msgid ""
"Open the OmniPanel system tray menu and toggle \"Zone Designer Mode\". Click "
"and drag your mouse on any monitor to draw a rectangular zone, name it, and "
"hit Save."
msgstr ""
"Open the OmniPanel system tray menu and toggle \"Zone Designer Mode\". Click "
"and drag your mouse on any monitor to draw a rectangular zone, name it, and "
"hit Save."

#: prefs_guide_about.js:118
msgid "Auto-Restore and Fuzzy Matching"
msgstr "Auto-Restore and Fuzzy Matching"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:119
msgid ""
"Layouts are automatically saved based on your current monitor setup. Unplug "
"and replug your screens, and your customized layouts return instantly."
msgstr ""
"Layouts are automatically saved based on your current monitor setup. Unplug "
"and replug your screens, and your customized layouts return instantly."

#: prefs_guide_about.js:125
msgid "Smart Placement & Exclusions"
msgstr "Smart Placement & Exclusions"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:128
msgid "Auto-Routing and Affinity"
msgstr "Auto-Routing and Affinity"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:129
msgid ""
"Name a zone \"Terminals\" and apps like Alacritty snap there automatically. "
"Drag a window into a different zone, and OmniPanel learns your preference "
"permanently."
msgstr ""
"Name a zone \"Terminals\" and apps like Alacritty snap there automatically. "
"Drag a window into a different zone, and OmniPanel learns your preference "
"permanently."

#: prefs_guide_about.js:134
msgid "Quick Desktop Access"
msgstr "Quick Desktop Access"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:135
msgid ""
"Use the \"Show Desktop\" button in the top bar to instantly minimize and "
"restore windows on your current monitor."
msgstr ""
"Use the \"Show Desktop\" button in the top bar to instantly minimize and "
"restore windows on your current monitor."

